[38;2;124;124;124mmany Borel sets of diameter $< 1/n$, pick a point in each, and define $f_n$ to [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mbe the function that on each piece equals $f(\text{picked point}, \cdot)$. Then [0m[38;2;124;124;124m$f_n$ is jointly measurable and $f_n \to f$ pointwise by continuity.[0m

