[38;2;124;124;124mNow, joint measurability + $\omega \mapsto f(\cdot, \omega) \in C(X)$ gives us [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mthat $\omega \mapsto f(\cdot, \omega)$ is measurable as a map into $C(X)$ with [0m
